WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.255
Step 1. Open the appointment or its encounter.

1.2
00:00:03.255 --> 00:00:07.305
When the visit is over, you mark the appointment as fulfilled.

1.3
00:00:07.305 --> 00:00:12.834
Select the appointment on the Appointments board to open Appointment Details.

2.1
00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:16.050
Step 2. Mark the appointment as fulfilled.

2.2
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:20.500
Select the menu button with three dots, then Mark as Fulfilled.

2.3
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.172
Care saves the change at once, with no confirmation,

2.4
00:00:24.172 --> 00:00:27.002
and the status becomes Fulfilled.
